title: The War Council
subtitle: The season's fighting, and where the Republic commits its strength next.
tags: event
view-if: war and battle_timer <= 0 and war_begins_seen and war_aim != "" and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.warCouncilOpen(Q); !}

= The War Council

**The Battle of [+ battle_name +].** The Confederacy struck at [+ battle_desc +], on [+ battle_front +]. [? if battle_won : Republic forces carry the day, at terrible cost. ?][? if not battle_won : Republic forces are thrown back, and the HoloNet is full of grim images. ?]

**The fronts:** [+ wc_fronts +]. The Republic is fighting for [+ war_aim_text +].

[? if wc_command : The War Council follows the Caucus's lead. Where does the Republic commit its strength this season? ?][? if not wc_command : The Chancellor's War Council means to [+ wc_gov_text +]. The Caucus can lobby for a different priority (1 political capital, and no guarantee), or let the plan stand. ?]

- @outer: Relieve the Outer Rim sieges.
- @mid: Secure the Hydian Way.
- @core: Fortify the Core approaches.
- @hold: Hold the line everywhere.
- @accept: Let the Council's plan stand.

@outer
view-if: wc_command or wc_gov_plan != "outer"
subtitle: The Rim front gains; the Rim is grateful, the Core feels exposed. [? if not wc_command : (Lobbying: 1 political capital.)?]
choose-if: wc_command or capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Lobbying needs 1 political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.warCouncilPriority(Q, 'outer'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma

@mid
view-if: wc_command or wc_gov_plan != "mid"
subtitle: The Hydian Way front gains; trade recovers and the guilds approve. [? if not wc_command : (Lobbying: 1 political capital.)?]
choose-if: wc_command or capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Lobbying needs 1 political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.warCouncilPriority(Q, 'mid'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma

@core
view-if: wc_command or wc_gov_plan != "core"
subtitle: The Core front gains and fear eases; the Rim feels abandoned. [? if not wc_command : (Lobbying: 1 political capital.)?]
choose-if: wc_command or capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Lobbying needs 1 political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.warCouncilPriority(Q, 'core'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma

@hold
view-if: wc_command or wc_gov_plan != "hold"
subtitle: −1 treasury. Every front steadies, and the war weighs more on everyone. [? if not wc_command : (Lobbying: 1 political capital.)?]
choose-if: wc_command or capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Lobbying needs 1 political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.warCouncilPriority(Q, 'hold'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma

@accept
view-if: not wc_command
subtitle: The Council will [+ wc_gov_text +].
on-arrival: {! SW.warCouncilPriority(Q, 'accept'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma
